* LVS REFERENCE netlist, written by AFE/layout/scripts/mk_lvs_netlists.py from the simulation netlists (AFE/review/AUDIT.md 4.9.3, Decision 44e).
* DO NOT EDIT: change the simulation netlist or the script and run the script again.  Options of this run: --decap-n 74,64 --dig-netlist AFE/dig/trial/afe_dig.pnl.v
* MIM = cap_mim_2f0_m4m5_noshield (terminal 1 = top plate, 2 = bottom plate, NOT interchangeable in LVS); all sizes are numbers; no ideal element.
* File dbs_afe_top.spice: the LVS top (L3), self-contained.  dbs_afe_top = afe_dig (black box) + bias_genc + 8 x afe_ch + supply devices; the 15 pad-control constants are pins of afe_dig;
* afe_ch = 2 routing TGATEs (TGATE/TGATE.spice, wells on the analog strap) + amp_ch + adc_ch.  The cell definitions are the same text as in afe_chc.spice, adc_ch.spice, bias_genc.spice.

